# Same-named bins with different at_least thresholds (1 and 2) in two runs
# whose automatic cross bins were never materialized: the run that met its
# threshold is credited one line and two toggle obligations and no functional
# one, and the other run nothing.
# Two runs that share a test name are told apart by their UUIDs wherever the
# page names them, including a list of both.
